window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>“You can’t help but fall in love with Lynsay Sands!”<br>—Christina Dodd</p><p><em>New York Times</em> bestselling author Lynsay Sands takes romance fans on <em>The Husband Hunt</em>. Bestselling author Suzanne Enoch, declares that, “Lynsay Sands hits all the right notes,” and any reader who has ever been touched by the unique Sands romantic magic—be it her delectable Argeneau family vampire novels, her Scottish highlands-set historicals, her marvelous Medieval love stories, or her delightful Regency Era romps—would no doubt enthusiastically agree. <em>The Husband Hunt</em> is a wild and captivating ride, as a rakish lord with no interest in marriage must fight his growing attraction for the enormously popular, exquisite beauty he ignored years earlier when she was merely a bright-eyed, infatuated child. <br></p>"; 
